@startuml
title Create order target v1 (DESIGNED)
actor Customer
participant "Java API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Go worker" as W
Customer -> API: POST /orders (idempotency key)
API -> DB: BEGIN; check key; insert order + outbox
alt transaction fails
DB --> API: error / rollback
API --> Customer: 4xx or 503, no success claim
else committed
DB --> API: committed order ID
API --> Customer: 201 (or replay 200)
W -> DB: claim event lease
DB --> W: event_id + order_id
W -> DB: durable idempotent effect + ack
note over W,DB
Crash after effect can cause redelivery;
no exactly-once claim
end note
end
@enduml
